      "author_association": "NONE",
      "body": "**Is your feature request related to a problem? Please describe.**\r\nWhen I have chrome on full screen and do \"window.show()\" it switches the screen to the desktop with the app.\r\n\r\n**Describe the solution you'd like**\r\nIt would be better if there was a feature which allowed me to bring the window to jut sit in front of the Chrome app while its on full screen rather than \"switch\" back to the desktop.\r\n\r\n**Additional context**\r\nhere is an example;\r\n<img width=\"1308\" alt=\"screenshot 2018-12-10 at 08 44 36\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/37438950/49770278-a456f600-fcdb-11e8-8274-aecf30f914bd.png\">\r\n",
